  "lessons": [
    {
      "id": "definition",
      "title": "Power must operate through clear and impartial rules",
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "id": "7cc458b8d0abbda7de995bd8ac03f59e8161320ab88f5f35a54e11c860b91798",
          "sha256": "cdc6dac19e9cfb9178a0868d2e7b0fca7d3eec1878626cf8a7fec8c67886f2e8",
          "locator": "Definition, clarity and Johnson classroom example"
        }
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The reading defines the rule of law by denying that any person, official or government is above the law. Its practical test is whether rules are clear enough for people to understand the conduct expected of them and are applied impartially.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "7cc458b8d0abbda7de995bd8ac03f59e8161320ab88f5f35a54e11c860b91798",
              "sha256": "cdc6dac19e9cfb9178a0868d2e7b0fca7d3eec1878626cf8a7fec8c67886f2e8",
              "locator": "Definition, clarity and Johnson classroom example"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The Johnson example challenges a vague vagrancy rule: simply waiting at a bus stop without much cash does not clearly demonstrate the behaviour described in the statute. The reading uses the scenario to connect predictable rules, evidence and limits on enforcement.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "7cc458b8d0abbda7de995bd8ac03f59e8161320ab88f5f35a54e11c860b91798",
              "sha256": "cdc6dac19e9cfb9178a0868d2e7b0fca7d3eec1878626cf8a7fec8c67886f2e8",
              "locator": "Definition, clarity and Johnson classroom example"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "tone": "key",
          "text": "The reading contains a problematic constitutional paraphrase using “pursuit of happiness”. Do not memorise that sentence as the text of an amendment. These notes retain its supported clarity-and-fairness lesson.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "7cc458b8d0abbda7de995bd8ac03f59e8161320ab88f5f35a54e11c860b91798",
              "sha256": "cdc6dac19e9cfb9178a0868d2e7b0fca7d3eec1878626cf8a7fec8c67886f2e8",
              "locator": "Definition, clarity and Johnson classroom example"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
